1
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:07,210
The Life Of Muhammadﷺ, Madinan Period Volume 2

2
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,694
By Imam Anwar Al_Awlaki,

3
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:13,420
اَعُوْذُ بِاللهِ مِنَّ الشِّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيْمِ۝بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمَانِ الرَّحِيْمَ۝

4
00:00:13,537 --> 00:00:19,483
اَلْحَمْدُ لله ، وَالصَّلَاةُ وَالسَّلَامُ عَلى سَيِّدِنَا محمد وَعَلَى اَلِهِ وَصَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تَسْلِيْمًا كَثِيْرا

5
00:00:19,916 --> 00:00:21,933
السلام عليكم ورحمة الله وبركاته

6
00:00:22,328 --> 00:00:23,514
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

7
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:38,282
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا إِنَّمَا الْمُشْرِكُونَ نَجَسٌ فَلَا يَقْرَبُوا الْمَسْجِدَ الْحَرَامَ بَعْدَ عَامِهِمْ هَٰذَا

8
00:00:38,931 --> 00:00:49,918
وَإِنْ خِفْتُمْ عَيْلَةً فَسَوْفَ يُغْنِيكُمُ اللَّهُ مِنْ فَضْلِهِ إِنْ شَاءَ ۚ

9
00:00:50,318 --> 00:00:54,794
إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ۝

10
00:00:55,432 --> 00:01:02,180
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says: O you, who have believed, indeed the polytheists are unclean.

11
00:01:02,606 --> 00:01:07,683
So, let them not approach Al-Masjid Al-Haram(ألمسجد الحرام), after this, their final year

12
00:01:08,136 --> 00:01:13,612
and if you fear privation, Allah will enrich you from His bounty, if He wills

13
00:01:14,218 --> 00:01:17,667
indeed Allah is Knowing and Wise.

14
00:01:18,515 --> 00:01:24,064
The people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) for centuries, their livelihood was based on doing business.

15
00:01:24,859 --> 00:01:29,569
They had an influx of people coming in for Hajj(حج) and Umrah(عمره), throughout the year.

16
00:01:30,009 --> 00:01:32,190
So, that was the foundation of their business.

17
00:01:32,914 --> 00:01:36,962
So, what they used to do is buy and trade with the people,

18
00:01:37,105 --> 00:01:40,280
who are coming in to Makkah throughout the year.

19
00:01:40,647 --> 00:01:44,954
That's all what they knew, how to do, they weren't into anything else.

20
00:01:45,257 --> 00:01:54,081
Rasool Allah ﷺ announced to the Mushrikeen(مشركين) that after this year, and this was in the ninth year of Hijrah(هجرة),

21
00:01:54,514 --> 00:01:58,191
No Mushrik(مشرك) is allowed into Al-Masjid Al-Haram(ألمسجد الحرام)!

22
00:01:58,274 --> 00:02:01,620
No Mushrik(مشرك) is allowed into Masjid Al-Haram(ألمسجد الحرام), into Makkah.

23
00:02:02,274 --> 00:02:08,675
To the people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) this was the catastrophe, the disaster, we're dead.

24
00:02:09,122 --> 00:02:11,627
Because not all of the Arabs have become Muslim yet.

25
00:02:11,698 --> 00:02:17,107
Yani(يعني) Najd(نجد) and all of those areas are not yet Muslim, you have Al-Hijaaz(الحجاز) is already Muslim,

26
00:02:17,147 --> 00:02:20,969
but the other parts of Arabia have not accepted Islam yet.

27
00:02:21,309 --> 00:02:26,655
So, the bulk of the Arabian Peninsula have not become Muslim.

28
00:02:27,026 --> 00:02:30,894
And these are the ones, who are going to come in and do Hajj(حج) and do Umrah(عمره).

29
00:02:31,359 --> 00:02:35,771
And these are the ones whom we depend on, for our livelihood.

30
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:41,031
And now, Rasool Allah ﷺ is saying that they're banned from entering the country.

31
00:02:41,435 --> 00:02:43,447
I mean, this is not good for the economy.

32
00:02:43,897 --> 00:02:46,923
And by the way, not only today are people thinking about the economy,

33
00:02:46,963 --> 00:02:52,062
 even then economy, financial resources was a major concern of the people.

34
00:02:52,627 --> 00:02:57,139
And a lot of the decisions that the politicians make are based on economical reasons.

35
00:02:57,627 --> 00:03:01,379
So, the people of Quraish(قريش), were thinking in economical terms

36
00:03:01,499 --> 00:03:04,087
and saying that this is not a wise decision.

37
00:03:04,412 --> 00:03:05,730
How are we going to live?

38
00:03:06,183 --> 00:03:09,168
And this is the Ayah(آية) that we just recited, Allahعَزّوجَلّ saying,

39
00:03:09,193 --> 00:03:12,344
O, you have believed indeed the polytheist are unclean.

40
00:03:12,384 --> 00:03:20,444
That's reasoning behind the banning of Mushrikeen(ألمشركين) from entering into Al-Haram(الحرم).

41
00:03:20,786 --> 00:03:23,459
The Ayah(آية) is saying that the reason why, they're not allowed in.?

42
00:03:23,499 --> 00:03:24,913
 Is because of their Nijasa(نجاسة).

43
00:03:25,145 --> 00:03:28,694
And then Allah says: So, let them not approach Al-Masjid Al-Haram(ألمسجد الحرام) after this.

44
00:03:29,161 --> 00:03:31,535
It's their final year Khalaas(خلاص), this is the last year,

45
00:03:31,559 --> 00:03:34,248
and this announcement was made in the ninth year of Hijrah(هجرة).

46
00:03:34,982 --> 00:03:40,919
And as a response to the complaints of the people, of Quraish(قريش), they are already Muslim.

47
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:44,446
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says and if you fear, privation,

48
00:03:44,918 --> 00:03:48,329
Allah will enrich you from His bounty, if He wills.

49
00:03:48,369 --> 00:03:51,140
Indeed Allah is Knowing and Wise.

50
00:03:51,316 --> 00:03:57,880
And this is Tawakkal(توكل) in Allahعَزّوجَلّ, if something is Haram(حرام), we stop from it.

51
00:03:57,932 --> 00:04:01,143
If something is Halaal(حلال), we encourage people to do it.

52
00:04:01,438 --> 00:04:03,568
That is how we base our decisions.

53
00:04:03,608 --> 00:04:06,275
It's not on what will make us money and what will not.

54
00:04:06,581 --> 00:04:12,216
So, Islam came to change the way people think, because people usually think in financial terms,

55
00:04:12,820 --> 00:04:17,247
 and decisions are made laws are made, in that sense.

56
00:04:17,676 --> 00:04:22,502
Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling them, if you have trust in Allahعَزّوجَلّ, Allah will provide for you.

57
00:04:22,887 --> 00:04:24,665
And it was difficult thing for Quraish(قُرَيْشْ)

58
00:04:24,705 --> 00:04:30,010
because, they didn't have any other skill or art to do and make money.

59
00:04:30,050 --> 00:04:34,142
I mean, the land in Makkah is not suitable for planting anything.

60
00:04:34,623 --> 00:04:40,281
It's very infertile dry land, rocky tracks and no rain.

61
00:04:40,574 --> 00:04:45,767
So, when business was their only job that they knew how to do,

62
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:49,905
and they're told not to do it, they were kind of concerned, they were worried.

63
00:04:50,268 --> 00:04:52,654
Allahعَزّوجَلّ told them Allah will provide for you, Khalas(خلاص).

64
00:04:53,003 --> 00:04:53,896
Allah will provide for you.

65
00:04:53,952 --> 00:04:57,799
Let's have Eeman(إيمان) in Allahعَزّوجَلّ let's do what Allahعَزّوجَلّ told us.

66
00:04:58,419 --> 00:05:02,998
And by the way, brothers, and sisters, this has many implications on us today,

67
00:05:03,038 --> 00:05:09,803
because there are a lot of Muslims, who deal with Ribaa(رباء), who sell Haraam(حرام) things

68
00:05:10,326 --> 00:05:14,706
and the reason is, this is the only way we can make money.

69
00:05:14,731 --> 00:05:18,260
So, they open a grocery store, and they sell things that are Haraam(حرام),

70
00:05:18,401 --> 00:05:20,948
you tell them this is Haraam(حرام), they say how are we going to live?

71
00:05:21,586 --> 00:05:24,483
And then you find people buying houses using mortgages,

72
00:05:24,507 --> 00:05:27,959
which is a clear Ribaa(رباء) without any doubts.

73
00:05:28,389 --> 00:05:30,703
And then they say, how are we going to survive,

74
00:05:30,738 --> 00:05:34,333
we're going to lose all of our money, if we keep on paying rent.

75
00:05:35,047 --> 00:05:37,702
 The response to these people is;

76
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:42,485
وَمَنْ يَتَّقِ اللَّهَ يَجْعَلْ لَهُ مَخْرَجًا۝وَيَرْزُقْهُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَحْتَسِبُ

77
00:05:42,956 --> 00:05:46,586
Whoever has Taqwa(تقوى), Allah will find a way out for them

78
00:05:46,856 --> 00:05:50,822
and will provide them from sources they never expected.

79
00:05:51,162 --> 00:05:56,054
It's a promise from Allahعَزّوجَلّ, if you have Taqwa(تقوى) and you believe in Allahعَزّوجَلّ,

80
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:59,707
then this is, what will happen Allah will provide for you.

81
00:05:59,890 --> 00:06:03,414
Put your trust in Allahعَزّوجَلّ and Allah will provide for you.

82
00:06:04,238 --> 00:06:06,375
So, how does Allah provide for the people of Makkah?

83
00:06:06,517 --> 00:06:08,327
The next Ayah(آية) verse 29.

84
00:06:08,684 --> 00:06:09,946
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

85
00:06:10,192 --> 00:06:18,692
قَاتِلُوا الَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِاللَّهِ وَلَا بِالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ وَلَا

86
00:06:19,057 --> 00:06:31,428
وَلَا يُحَرِّمُونَ مَا حَرَّمَ اللَّهُ وَرَسُولُهُ وَلَا يَدِينُونَ دِينَ الْحَقِّ مِنَ الَّذِينَ أُوتُوا الْكِتَابَ حَتَّىٰ

87
00:06:31,745 --> 00:06:38,738
حَتَّىٰ يُعْطُوا الْجِزْيَةَ عَنْ يَدٍ وَهُمْ صَاغِرُونَ۝

88
00:06:39,289 --> 00:06:43,497
Fight those, who do not believe in Allah, or in the last day,

89
00:06:44,048 --> 00:06:49,383
and who do not consider unlawful what Allah and His Messenger have made unlawful,

90
00:06:49,832 --> 00:06:55,523
and who do not adopt the religion of truth from those who're given the Scripture,

91
00:06:55,919 --> 00:07:01,056
fight until, they give the Jizya(جزيه) willingly while they are humbled.

92
00:07:01,928 --> 00:07:08,877
This is how Ibn Kathir(اِبْنِ كَثِيْر) starts the chapter on the events of the ninth year of Hijrah(هجرة).

93
00:07:09,272 --> 00:07:15,050
And this is how he opens, his section on the Battle of Tabook(تبوك),

94
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:18,983
it is by giving a brief Tafseer(تفسير) of these two Ayaat(آيات).

95
00:07:19,542 --> 00:07:27,188
The order from Allahعَزّوجَلّ in verse 123, of Surah Taubah(سورة توبة), Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

96
00:07:27,571 --> 00:07:39,474
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا قَاتِلُوا الَّذِينَ يَلُونَكُمْ مِنَ الْكُفَّارِ وَلْيَجِدُوا فِيكُمْ غِلْظَةً

97
00:07:40,010 --> 00:07:46,504
وَاعْلَمُوا أَنَّ اللَّهَ مَعَ الْمُتَّقِينَ۝

98
00:07:46,852 --> 00:07:53,171
O, you, who have believed! Fight those, adjacent to you, of the disbelievers

99
00:07:53,518 --> 00:08:00,382
and let them find in you harshness and know that Allah is with the righteous.

100
00:08:01,253 --> 00:08:05,258
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says, fight those adjacent to you.

101
00:08:06,041 --> 00:08:11,506
Who are the ones adjacent to the Muslims now, in the ninth year of Hijrah(هجرة)?

102
00:08:11,641 --> 00:08:12,641
It is the Romans.

103
00:08:12,984 --> 00:08:17,468
Because the Roman Empire reaches to the boundary of Hijaaz(حجاز).

104
00:08:18,183 --> 00:08:23,373
So, the first people who are included in this Ayah(آية) are the Romans,

105
00:08:23,397 --> 00:08:27,231
because when this is Ayah(آية) was revealed all of the Arabs of Hijaaz(حجاز), were Muslim.

106
00:08:27,775 --> 00:08:37,809
And Rasool Allah ﷺ started the greatest mobilization ever, in the history of Islam, so far.

107
00:08:38,214 --> 00:08:43,970
Rasool Allah ﷺ usually, when he would lead an army or send out an army,

108
00:08:44,446 --> 00:08:52,423
 he would maintain secrecy of the target, in order to ambush the enemy and take them by surprise.

109
00:08:53,035 --> 00:08:58,092
However, in this incident, Rasool Allah ﷺ made it public from day one.

110
00:08:58,230 --> 00:08:58,929
Why?

111
00:08:59,059 --> 00:09:04,422
First of all, because they're facing a new enemy, they are facing the Roman Empire.

112
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:08,957
And you know this is a different situation here.

113
00:09:08,997 --> 00:09:10,936
Here now, we're not facing a tribe

114
00:09:11,272 --> 00:09:14,776
and we're not facing people from our own kind, whom we already know.

115
00:09:15,319 --> 00:09:18,060
This is something that is unknown.

116
00:09:18,632 --> 00:09:20,406
It is a foreign nation.

117
00:09:20,916 --> 00:09:28,837
Plus, the Roman Empire has such a great reputation all over the world, for its strength and power.

118
00:09:29,234 --> 00:09:32,440
And this reputation is centuries old,

119
00:09:32,853 --> 00:09:39,089
Therefore Rasool Allah ﷺ made it clear from the beginning that we are going to fight Ar-Rome(ألروم).

120
00:09:39,773 --> 00:09:44,369
The next, second reason is because of the distance,

121
00:09:44,863 --> 00:09:47,634
there's gonna be a lot of traveling involved,

122
00:09:48,068 --> 00:09:51,740
and therefore, Rasool Allah ﷺ wanted them to prepare accordingly.

123
00:09:52,353 --> 00:09:59,047
I mean, this is not a short distance travel, and therefore a lot of preparation is needed.

124
00:09:59,645 --> 00:10:06,596
And the third reason, it was the worst time of the year to travel, it was mid-summer, very hot.

125
00:10:07,249 --> 00:10:14,395
And it was the time when the dates are ripening on the palm trees.

126
00:10:14,915 --> 00:10:17,597
And that's a very tempting time to stay behind

127
00:10:17,637 --> 00:10:22,538
because the life of the people of Madina was based on agriculture

128
00:10:22,578 --> 00:10:30,912
and their agriculture was pretty much mostly palm dates, that was the main agriculture of the people of Al-Ansaar(الأنْصَار).

129
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:35,245
So, you wait all year long for the harvest.

130
00:10:35,285 --> 00:10:42,284
And now, we're supposed to travel right at that time when the fruit is ripening on the tree, and it's very tempting.

131
00:10:42,929 --> 00:10:46,884
So, it was a very difficult time to set out.

132
00:10:47,512 --> 00:10:53,004
But the Battle of Tabook(تبوك) is going to be the last major trial

133
00:10:53,044 --> 00:10:56,602
that the Muslims are going to go through before the death of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

134
00:10:57,231 --> 00:11:04,417
And you will notice that the Battle of Tabook(تبوك) represents the peak of Islam,

135
00:11:04,921 --> 00:11:08,908
and represents the most difficult test so far.

136
00:11:09,405 --> 00:11:19,474
And it was the Battle of Tabook(تبوك) that brought down the Ayaat(آيات) that are talking about the Nifaaq(نفاق) and Eeman(إيمان).

137
00:11:20,242 --> 00:11:26,084
So, this was going to be the criteria between the true believers and the Munafiqeen(منافقين),

138
00:11:26,611 --> 00:11:30,848
this is a closing chapter in the Jihad(جهاد), of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

139
00:11:31,118 --> 00:11:35,605
So, now the final laws of fighting are going to come.

140
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:39,358
These are the Ayaat(آيات) that will abrogate the Ayaat(آيات) before.

141
00:11:39,792 --> 00:11:45,489
And the Ayaat(آيات) that will expose the Munafiqeen(منافقين) are going to come down in Tabook(تبوك),

142
00:11:45,529 --> 00:11:50,614
 even though the phenomena of Nifaaq(نفاق) is a few years old by now

143
00:11:50,808 --> 00:11:54,965
because Nifaaq(نفاق) appeared in Madina, right after the Battle of Badr(بدر).

144
00:11:55,664 --> 00:12:00,460
So, we're talking about a span of seven years of the existence of the Nifaaq(نفاق).

145
00:12:00,737 --> 00:12:07,133
Nevertheless, the Surah(سورة) that talk the most about Nifaaq(نفاق) is the Surah(سورة) of At-Taubah(ألتوبة).

146
00:12:07,403 --> 00:12:12,430
And Surah At-Taubah(سورة التوبة) was revealed in the ninth year of Hijrah(هجرة),

147
00:12:12,809 --> 00:12:16,059
which was the year in which the battle of Tabook(تبوك) occurred.

148
00:12:16,250 --> 00:12:21,564
And most of the Ayaat(آيات) of Surah At-Taubah(سورة التوبة) are relating to the Battle of Tabook(تبوك).

149
00:12:21,779 --> 00:12:24,823
So, these are prime moments, very important moments.

150
00:12:25,210 --> 00:12:29,945
And we're getting close to the end of the Daw'ah(دعوة) of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

151
00:12:30,121 --> 00:12:33,848
So, what we're talking about now, brothers and sisters are the final stages.

152
00:12:34,188 --> 00:12:36,660
What we're talking about now are the final chapters.

153
00:12:36,922 --> 00:12:40,667
And they are the final and most important ones.

154
00:12:41,022 --> 00:12:43,296
I mean, this is even though in the Battle of Tabook(تبوك).

155
00:12:43,569 --> 00:12:46,397
There was no fighting, but it was an epic event.

156
00:12:46,803 --> 00:12:52,199
It has such an importance in Shariah(شريعة), and in Seerah(سيرة) and in Aqeedah(عقيدة)

157
00:12:52,445 --> 00:12:55,567
in every aspect of Islamic knowledge.

158
00:12:56,532 --> 00:13:00,145
And that's why we'll be going through a lot of Ayaat(آيات)

159
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:06,972
because there are so many Ayaat(آيات) that were revealed in Surah At-Taubah(سورة التوبة) of about the Battle of Tabook(تبوك).

160
00:13:07,677 --> 00:13:08,689
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ said:

161
00:13:08,713 --> 00:13:16,035
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا قَاتِلُوا الَّذِينَ يَلُونَكُمْ مِنَ الْكُفَّارِ وَلْيَجِدُوا فِيكُمْ غِلْظَةً ۚ وَاعْلَمُوا أَنَّ اللَّهَ مَعَ الْمُتَّقِينَ۝

162
00:13:16,235 --> 00:13:21,512
O you, who have believed, fight those adjacent to you of the disbelievers

163
00:13:21,758 --> 00:13:25,785
and let them find in you harshness and know that Allah is with the righteous.

164
00:13:25,809 --> 00:13:29,800
So again, the battle Tabook(تبوك) represents a trial from Allahعَزّوجَلّ

165
00:13:29,825 --> 00:13:32,093
because again, as I mentioned, there was no fighting involved.

166
00:13:32,457 --> 00:13:37,523
But it was a test, and it represented the most difficult battle so far.

167
00:13:38,118 --> 00:13:47,218
And that is the reason why? This battle was given the name Jaish Al Usra(جيش ألعسره),

168
00:13:47,927 --> 00:13:49,505
the army of difficulty.

169
00:13:49,806 --> 00:13:52,171
Usrah(عسره) means difficult, severe, tough,

170
00:13:52,430 --> 00:13:56,620
because the financing of the army was difficult,

171
00:13:57,486 --> 00:13:59,818
 the Gathering of the army was difficult,

172
00:14:00,254 --> 00:14:02,587
the travel of the army was difficult,

173
00:14:02,889 --> 00:14:05,079
the weather was difficult,

174
00:14:05,967 --> 00:14:08,842
and the enemy that they're facing is difficult.

175
00:14:09,437 --> 00:14:12,477
And that's why it's called the Battle of difficulty,

176
00:14:12,566 --> 00:14:15,645
Jaish Al-Usrah(جيش ألعسره), or the army of difficulty.

177
00:14:16,239 --> 00:14:19,432
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ has called it in Qur'an Sa'ah Tul Usrah(ساعة العسره),

178
00:14:19,635 --> 00:14:23,895
the hour of difficulty and we'll get to that Ayah(آية), In sha Allah(اِنْ شاءالله).

179
00:14:24,514 --> 00:14:25,578
THE MOBILIZATION;

180
00:14:25,648 --> 00:14:38,949
Rasool Allah ﷺ called the people, who're in Madina, and the surrounding tribes, and Makkah, all over, all of the Muslims.

181
00:14:39,542 --> 00:14:42,288
There was never such a mobilization before.

182
00:14:42,816 --> 00:14:47,945
And Rasool Allah ﷺ wanted to recruit every able bodied Muslim.

183
00:14:48,331 --> 00:14:59,636
And the Ayaat(آيات) of Qur'an, came to support this and to lay down the final laws regarding fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

184
00:14:59,704 --> 00:15:03,351
 Allahعَزّوجَلّ says in verse 38, Surah At-Taubah(سورة التوبة).

185
00:15:03,598 --> 00:15:16,072
يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَا لَكُمْ إِذَا قِيلَ لَكُمُ انْفِرُوا فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ اثَّاقَلْتُمْ إِلَى الْأَرْضِ

186
00:15:17,006 --> 00:15:30,530
أَرَضِيتُمْ بِالْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا مِنَ الْآخِرَةِ ۚ فَمَا مَتَاعُ الْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا فِي الْآخِرَةِ إِلَّا قَلِيلٌ۝

187
00:15:31,066 --> 00:15:33,127
The call was difficult,

188
00:15:33,912 --> 00:15:40,143
and therefore people were finding it hard convincing themselves to come out.

189
00:15:40,570 --> 00:15:47,931
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ in this Ayah(آية), and you see brothers and sisters Qur'an speaks to the heart.

190
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:57,935
And it exposes the heart and tells you the illness that is in the heart, whether you know it or not.

191
00:15:58,277 --> 00:16:01,768
And that is something unique about Qur'an

192
00:16:01,909 --> 00:16:07,540
because it is from Allahعَزّوجَلّ, it is the word of Allahعَزّوجَلّ, it is from the One, Who created you

193
00:16:08,188 --> 00:16:10,655
and knows what is good for you and what is bad

194
00:16:10,695 --> 00:16:17,254
and knows what is happening in the inner, in your heart of heart, what is happening inside.

195
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:22,350
And these are things that you might not even recognize yourself, within yourself.

196
00:16:23,003 --> 00:16:28,853
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling the people the reason why, they do not want to go out.?

197
00:16:29,315 --> 00:16:33,245
Because you see, people might give many reasons,

198
00:16:33,768 --> 00:16:38,215
they might say because the Fiqh(فقه) does not state we have to go out.

199
00:16:38,656 --> 00:16:40,979
Some might say because there is a difference of opinion,

200
00:16:41,226 --> 00:16:43,494
some might say because it doesn't make sense.

201
00:16:43,669 --> 00:16:46,058
Some might say because it's not it's not wise.

202
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:48,539
But Allahعَزّوجَلّ tells them why?

203
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:52,889
O you, who have believed, what is the matter with you,

204
00:16:53,139 --> 00:16:59,626
that when you are told to go forth in the cause of Allah, you adhere heavily to Earth,

205
00:16:59,847 --> 00:17:04,058
that is the reason it is love of Duniyah(دُنِيَّا), it is adherence to the earth.

206
00:17:04,465 --> 00:17:09,078
Are you satisfied with the life of this world rather than the hereafter.

207
00:17:09,637 --> 00:17:15,473
But what is the enjoyment of worldly life compared to the hereafter, except a very little.

208
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:19,070
So, this Ayah(آية) mentions the cause, and it mentions the cure,

209
00:17:19,095 --> 00:17:20,810
it mentions the disease and the cure.

210
00:17:21,151 --> 00:17:22,913
The disease is, attachment to Duniyah(دُنِيَّا).

211
00:17:23,228 --> 00:17:24,697
اثَّاقَلْتُمْ إِلَى الْأَرْضِ

212
00:17:24,722 --> 00:17:27,117
You are adhering to Earth.

213
00:17:27,662 --> 00:17:31,442
You love your life, and you don't want to leave it behind.

214
00:17:32,032 --> 00:17:33,262
And the cure is

215
00:17:33,635 --> 00:17:37,539
Allahعَزّوجَلّ is reminding us with the reality of this world

216
00:17:37,730 --> 00:17:39,843
that it is nothing compared to the hereafter.

217
00:17:40,628 --> 00:17:43,248
And from day one, this Ayah(آية) is in At-Toubah(ألتوبة),

218
00:17:43,423 --> 00:17:51,229
the first Ayaat(آيات) which were in Surah Al-Baqarah(سورة ألبقره), where the command to fight with was given.

219
00:17:51,490 --> 00:17:52,478
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

220
00:17:52,580 --> 00:17:54,793
كُتِبَ عَلَيْكُمُ الْقِتَالُ وَهُوَ كُرْهٌ لَكُمْ

221
00:17:55,219 --> 00:17:58,346
Fighting has been prescribed on you, while you dislike it.

222
00:17:58,725 --> 00:18:01,195
Allahعَزّوجَلّ told us: This is something that we dislike.

223
00:18:01,887 --> 00:18:06,190
We even not only dislike to do, we dislike to talk about it.

224
00:18:06,374 --> 00:18:09,666
And look at it right now, how many people are talking about this,

225
00:18:10,204 --> 00:18:12,331
even though it is one of the Faraidh(فرائض) in Islam,

226
00:18:12,356 --> 00:18:16,503
even though there are so many Ayaat(آيات) and so many Ahadith(أحاديث) talking about this,

227
00:18:16,686 --> 00:18:19,573
but people don't want to speak about it, let alone do it.

228
00:18:20,218 --> 00:18:23,884
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling us what the disease is and giving us the cure.

229
00:18:24,201 --> 00:18:29,155
And then Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling us what will happen if we don't fight in His sake.

230
00:18:29,242 --> 00:18:30,481
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

231
00:18:30,662 --> 00:18:42,822
إِلَّا تَنْفِرُوا يُعَذِّبْكُمْ عَذَابًا أَلِيمًا وَيَسْتَبْدِلْ قَوْمًا غَيْرَكُمْ وَلَا تَضُرُّوهُ شَيْئًا ۗ

232
00:18:42,925 --> 00:18:47,624
وَاللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ۝

233
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:54,790
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says: If you do not go forth, He will punish you with a painful punishment.

234
00:18:55,490 --> 00:18:58,811
And our condition today is a testimony to this.

235
00:18:59,329 --> 00:19:02,879
Look at how we are being punished because we're staying behind.

236
00:19:03,229 --> 00:19:05,830
We are poor even though we are the wealthiest

237
00:19:06,217 --> 00:19:10,588
our land and what is beneath our land is wealthy.

238
00:19:10,859 --> 00:19:12,234
Nevertheless, we're poor.

239
00:19:12,574 --> 00:19:16,747
We are disunited even though we should be the most United Ummah(امة).

240
00:19:17,272 --> 00:19:20,983
We are weak when we should be the highest and strongest Ummah(امة).

241
00:19:21,417 --> 00:19:26,239
All of this is punishment from Allahعَزّوجَلّ because we did not give support to His Deen(دين).

242
00:19:26,907 --> 00:19:30,951
If you do not go forth, He will punish you with a painful punishment

243
00:19:31,268 --> 00:19:33,902
and will replace you with another people

244
00:19:34,164 --> 00:19:38,292
and you will not harm Him at all and Allah is over all things competent.

245
00:19:39,425 --> 00:19:42,899
So, this is the punishment of Allah and Allah is warning the Muslims

246
00:19:42,924 --> 00:19:47,744
because as I said many of them do not like talking about this, let alone doing it.

247
00:19:48,061 --> 00:19:51,088
In fact not only talking about it, they don't even want hear about it,

248
00:19:51,548 --> 00:19:53,049
and then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

249
00:19:53,229 --> 00:19:59,144
إِلَّا تَنْصُرُوهُ فَقَدْ نَصَرَهُ اللَّهُ

250
00:19:59,486 --> 00:20:08,961
إِذْ أَخْرَجَهُ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا ثَانِيَ اثْنَيْنِ إِذْ هُمَا فِي الْغَارِ إِذْ يَقُولُ لِصَاحِبِهِ

251
00:20:09,513 --> 00:20:16,718
إِذْ يَقُولُ لِصَاحِبِهِ لَا تَحْزَنْ إِنَّ اللَّهَ مَعَنَا

252
00:20:17,101 --> 00:20:25,823
 فَأَنْزَلَ اللَّهُ سَكِينَتَهُ عَلَيْهِ وَأَيَّدَهُ بِجُنُودٍ لَمْ تَرَوْهَا

253
00:20:26,111 --> 00:20:33,949
وَجَعَلَ كَلِمَةَ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا السُّفْلَىٰ ۗ وَكَلِمَةُ اللَّهِ هِيَ الْعُلْيَا ۗ

254
00:20:34,211 --> 00:20:37,699
وَاللَّهُ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ۝

255
00:20:38,281 --> 00:20:43,399
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says; If you do not aid the Prophet, Allah has already aided him.

256
00:20:43,762 --> 00:20:45,999
If we do not defend Rasool Allah ﷺ,

257
00:20:46,261 --> 00:20:49,091
 if we do not defend the honor of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

258
00:20:49,341 --> 00:20:50,852
if we do not protect him,

259
00:20:51,336 --> 00:20:54,994
Rasool Allah ﷺ does not need us, Allahعَزّوجَلّ will protect him.

260
00:20:55,238 --> 00:20:59,496
It is something that we need to do for our own sake for our own benefit.

261
00:21:00,203 --> 00:21:03,453
But Allahعَزّوجَلّ will support His messenger.

262
00:21:03,850 --> 00:21:07,248
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says; Allah has already aided him,

263
00:21:07,428 --> 00:21:15,394
when those who disbelieve had driven him out of Makkah as one of two, he and Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) in the Hijrah(هجرة).

264
00:21:15,450 --> 00:21:21,249
When they were in the cave and he said to his companion, do not grieve Rasool Ullah speaking to Abu Bakr(ابوبكر).

265
00:21:21,289 --> 00:21:24,045
Do not grieve indeed Allah is with us,

266
00:21:24,245 --> 00:21:27,221
and Allah sent down his tranquility upon him

267
00:21:27,389 --> 00:21:34,106
and supported him with angels, you did not see and made the word of those, who disbelieved, the lowest,

268
00:21:34,495 --> 00:21:40,317
while the word of Allah that is the highest, and Allah is exalted in Might and Wise.

269
00:21:40,802 --> 00:21:42,680
And then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

270
00:21:42,837 --> 00:21:50,553
اِنْفِرُوا خِفَافًا وَثِقَالًا وَجَاهِدُوا بِأَمْوَالِكُمْ

271
00:21:50,904 --> 00:21:58,405
وَجَاهِدُوا بِأَمْوَالِكُمْ وَأَنْفُسِكُمْ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ ۚ

272
00:21:58,802 --> 00:22:05,516
ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَكُمْ إِنْ كُنْتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ۝

273
00:22:05,961 --> 00:22:10,990
Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling the Sahabah(صحابه) and telling us and telling every Muslim.

274
00:22:11,204 --> 00:22:18,694
 Go forth, Whether light or heavy and strive with your wealth and your lives in the cause of Allah.

275
00:22:18,963 --> 00:22:21,580
That is better for you, if you only knew.

276
00:22:22,694 --> 00:22:24,375
اِنْفِرُوا خِفَافًا وَثِقَالًا

277
00:22:24,399 --> 00:22:27,169
Go forth, whether light or heavy! What does light or heavy mean?

278
00:22:27,541 --> 00:22:31,445
Al-Qurtabi(ألقرطبي) mentions the opinions of the scholars of Tafseer(تفسير).

279
00:22:32,050 --> 00:22:40,347
They said: Young and old, busy or not busy, wealthy or poor, everyone needs to go out.

280
00:22:40,428 --> 00:22:43,768
When this Ayah(آية) was revealed the Sahabah(صحابه) viewed this, as such a burden,

281
00:22:43,793 --> 00:22:47,064
they said: That no one has an excuse everybody has to go out.

282
00:22:47,777 --> 00:22:50,401
And that is when Allahعَزّوجَلّ revealed the Ayah(آية) ;

283
00:22:50,522 --> 00:23:01,482
لَيْسَ عَلَى الضُّعَفَاءِ وَلَا عَلَى الْمَرْضَىٰ وَلَا عَلَى الَّذِينَ لَا يَجِدُونَ مَا يُنْفِقُونَ

284
00:23:01,791 --> 00:23:09,176
لَا يَجِدُونَ مَا يُنْفِقُونَ حَرَجٌ إِذَا نَصَحُوا لِلَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِ

285
00:23:09,398 --> 00:23:13,736
 مَا عَلَى الْمُحْسِنِينَ مِنْ سَبِيلٍ ۚ

286
00:23:13,918 --> 00:23:17,260
وَاللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَحِيمٌ۝

287
00:23:17,519 --> 00:23:24,046
There is not upon the weak, or upon the ill, or upon those who do not find anything to spend,

288
00:23:24,543 --> 00:23:28,689
any discomfort when they are sincere to Allah and His messenger.

289
00:23:29,021 --> 00:23:34,653
There is not upon the doers of good any cause for blame and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.

290
00:23:34,677 --> 00:23:41,521
So, Allah excused the weak and the ill and the ones who do not find anything to spend.

291
00:23:41,887 --> 00:23:44,255
Otherwise everyone else needs to go out.

292
00:23:44,675 --> 00:23:48,659
I mean, Abu Qatadah(ابو قتادة), the knight of Rasool Ullah رضي الله عنه,

293
00:23:49,114 --> 00:23:50,772
he was seen on it horse

294
00:23:50,812 --> 00:23:55,077
and he was such an old man that his eyebrows were covering his eyes.

295
00:23:55,117 --> 00:23:58,593
And he was by then, he gained a lot of weight.

296
00:23:59,196 --> 00:24:03,557
So, he was told that you are among the ones who're excused, why are you going out?

297
00:24:03,929 --> 00:24:07,425
He said the Surah(سورة) of At-Taubah(ألتوبة) has left us no excuse.

298
00:24:07,956 --> 00:24:10,777
That was the understanding of the Sahabah رضي الله عنهم.

299
00:24:11,655 --> 00:24:14,275
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ is saying go forth with light and heavy

300
00:24:14,300 --> 00:24:16,779
and then Allah says and strive with your wealth and your lives.

301
00:24:16,884 --> 00:24:21,909
Notice here that the wealth was mentioned before the lives and that is how it is in every Ayah(آية).

302
00:24:22,334 --> 00:24:24,409
Except in one Ayah(آية) in Qur'an.

303
00:24:24,449 --> 00:24:28,044
And that is because fighting consumes money.

304
00:24:28,203 --> 00:24:29,904
I mean, it just burns it away.

305
00:24:30,238 --> 00:24:32,587
That was the case then and that's the case now.

306
00:24:32,611 --> 00:24:39,885
I mean, fighting any war effort just swallows up money and that is why.?

307
00:24:40,085 --> 00:24:44,264
Allahعَزّوجَلّ in the Ayaat(آيات) of Qur'an and Rasool Allah ﷺ in the Ahadith(أحاديث)

308
00:24:44,776 --> 00:24:48,435
emphasized on the importance of spending Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(في سبيل الله).

309
00:24:48,851 --> 00:24:54,169
In fact Al-Qurtabi(ألقرطبي) says, that every other Sadaqah(صدقه) is multiplied by 10.

310
00:24:54,443 --> 00:24:55,880
Because Rasool Allah ﷺ says that

311
00:24:56,208 --> 00:24:57,870
اَلْحَسَنَةْ بِعَشَرَةْ اَمثالِهَا

312
00:24:58,194 --> 00:25:00,124
One good deed is multiplied by 10.

313
00:25:00,346 --> 00:25:06,662
Except when you spend in the path of Allah it is equivalent to 700 because of the Ayah(آية) in Surat Ul Baqarah(سورة البقره)

314
00:25:07,002 --> 00:25:10,749
that talks about the grain that multiplies into 700.

315
00:25:11,027 --> 00:25:13,699
And that is when it is  spent in Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(في سبيل الله).

316
00:25:13,965 --> 00:25:17,066
And Ibn Al-Hajar(إبن حجر) says that whenever Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله) is mentioned,

317
00:25:17,476 --> 00:25:21,381
it usually means the context of Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(في سبيل الله),

318
00:25:21,667 --> 00:25:23,652
and therefore Al-Qurtabi(ألقرطبي) says that

319
00:25:23,978 --> 00:25:28,082
every other spending whether it is for the poor, or the needy, or building a Masjid(مسجد) or whatever

320
00:25:28,430 --> 00:25:33,244
1 dollar or one, whatever currency it is, is multiplied by 10,

321
00:25:33,429 --> 00:25:38,181
while when it is for the fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله), one equals 700.

322
00:25:38,457 --> 00:25:43,981
And that is to emphasize the importance of spending because it's such an expensive thing.

323
00:25:44,902 --> 00:25:46,682
I mean, it just incinerate money.

324
00:25:47,214 --> 00:25:51,775
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ started fundraising, collecting the donations,

325
00:25:51,799 --> 00:25:55,326
He would stand up and ask the people to give

326
00:25:55,731 --> 00:26:00,758
and it was a difficult time in terms of the financial resources of the people that didn't have much,

327
00:26:01,050 --> 00:26:04,211
especially that is before the harvest and that is where their money is.

328
00:26:04,495 --> 00:26:09,141
But they were still bringing Abu Bakr(ابوبكر) brought his money and Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب)

329
00:26:09,605 --> 00:26:11,670
and then Rasool Allah ﷺ was asking for more,

330
00:26:11,979 --> 00:26:20,534
So Uthman Ibn Affan رضي الله عنه brought a 100 camels ready with their saddles and all, the whole thing.

331
00:26:21,077 --> 00:26:24,990
And then Rasool Allah ﷺ asked for more Uthman Ibn Affan(عثمان بن عفان) brought 100

332
00:26:25,549 --> 00:26:28,994
and then Rasool Allah ﷺ asked for more, so he brought 100

333
00:26:29,443 --> 00:26:34,527
and then Rasool Allah ﷺ asked for more, so Uthman Ibn Affan(عثمان بن عفان) brought some gold coins,

334
00:26:34,949 --> 00:26:37,795
and they poured it, in the lap of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

335
00:26:38,241 --> 00:26:42,136
So, Rasool Allah was had his fingers in these coins and

336
00:26:42,447 --> 00:26:47,082
I mean, they were in his lap and his fingers were in the coins. And Rasool Allah ﷺ said;

337
00:26:47,107 --> 00:26:49,481
مَا ضَرَّ عُثْمَان مَا فَعَلَ بَعْدَ الْيَوْمَ

338
00:26:50,477 --> 00:26:54,061
Nothing Uthman(عثمان) does after this day, would harm him.

339
00:26:54,885 --> 00:27:01,110
Whatever he does, that's it, he is forgiven, because of what he has done on this day.

340
00:27:01,684 --> 00:27:05,823
And this shows you the virtue of spending Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

341
00:27:06,905 --> 00:27:13,064
Then there were those, who are looking for excuses to get out of their duties.

342
00:27:13,557 --> 00:27:19,169
And let's read the Ayaat(آيات) that talk about them. Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

343
00:27:19,377 --> 00:27:28,303
وَإِذَا أُنْزِلَتْ سُورَةٌ أَنْ آمِنُوا بِاللَّهِ وَجَاهِدُوا مَعَ رَسُولِهِ

344
00:27:28,643 --> 00:27:38,063
اسْتَأْذَنَكَ أُولُو الطَّوْلِ مِنْهُمْ وَقَالُوا ذَرْنَا نَكُنْ مَعَ الْقَاعِدِينَ۝

345
00:27:38,087 --> 00:27:47,698
رَضُوا بِأَنْ يَكُونُوا مَعَ الْخَوَالِفِ وَطُبِعَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ۝

346
00:27:48,665 --> 00:27:53,412
And when a Surah(سورة) was revealed, enjoining them to believe in Allah

347
00:27:53,491 --> 00:28:00,813
and to fight with His messenger, those of wealth among them, ask your permission to stay back and said;

348
00:28:01,050 --> 00:28:04,173
 Leave us to be with them, who sit at home.

349
00:28:05,091 --> 00:28:08,329
And who are these, who are asking to be excused.?

350
00:28:08,702 --> 00:28:10,020
They are the ones with wealth,

351
00:28:10,372 --> 00:28:16,108
so the exact ones, who should be going out are the exact ones, who are asking for an excuse to stay,

352
00:28:16,371 --> 00:28:18,560
and this shows us the Fitnah(فِتْنَه) of money.

353
00:28:18,719 --> 00:28:20,965
I mean, money in itself is not evil.

354
00:28:21,704 --> 00:28:28,518
But if it causes a person to forsake their duties towards Allah and His religion,

355
00:28:28,700 --> 00:28:30,523
then it becomes an evil instrument.

356
00:28:30,651 --> 00:28:34,304
And here in this Ayah(آية) we find that these people came to Rasool Allah ﷺ and said;

357
00:28:34,328 --> 00:28:37,526
"We don't want to go, Excuse us!" Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

358
00:28:37,551 --> 00:28:41,650
رَضُوا بِأَنْ يَكُونُوا مَعَ الْخَوَالِفِ وَطُبِعَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ۝

359
00:28:42,437 --> 00:28:46,348
They were satisfied to be with those who stay behind, women and children.

360
00:28:47,256 --> 00:28:51,870
And their hearts were sealed over, so they do not understand.

361
00:28:52,323 --> 00:28:57,045
Pay attention to this, these people have heard Qur'an.

362
00:28:57,331 --> 00:29:05,484
And these are people, who sat in, the Khut'bah(خطبه) and the lectures of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

363
00:29:06,082 --> 00:29:09,707
so most likely, they know more than me and you

364
00:29:10,072 --> 00:29:13,403
and Allahعَزّوجَلّ says about them: La Yafqahoon(لا يفقهون).

365
00:29:13,585 --> 00:29:14,652
They have no understanding.

366
00:29:15,067 --> 00:29:18,783
People who heard Qur'an fresh from the heavens,

367
00:29:19,131 --> 00:29:23,508
and heard the Hadith(حديث) not from a book, but from the mouth of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

368
00:29:23,841 --> 00:29:26,421
and lived in the context, you see,

369
00:29:26,816 --> 00:29:31,134
they lived in the context of when the verses were revealed, and when they Hadith(حديث) was said.

370
00:29:31,668 --> 00:29:33,428
So, no matter how much we read,

371
00:29:33,912 --> 00:29:38,131
we will not reach to that understanding, because we were not there.

372
00:29:39,014 --> 00:29:42,422
And still Allah says that they do not understand.

373
00:29:42,973 --> 00:29:48,178
By today's standards, they would be great scholars, but they do not understand.

374
00:29:48,526 --> 00:29:50,279
Why.? Because they don't get the point.

375
00:29:50,869 --> 00:29:55,409
They do not understand the reality of Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) and Akhirah(آخرة),

376
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:59,751
they do not understand the wisdom behind Jihad(جهاد) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(في سبيل الله),

377
00:30:00,303 --> 00:30:05,570
they do not understand the importance of sacrifice, they just don't get it.

378
00:30:06,101 --> 00:30:15,748
And many are the Muslims today who don't get it, who don't understand the proper Islamic view of the world.

379
00:30:15,974 --> 00:30:23,145
And they do not understand the issue of the importance of supporting the Deen(دين) of Allahعَزّوجَلّ.

380
00:30:23,722 --> 00:30:29,428
So, understanding brothers and sisters is not how many Ayaat(آيات) and how many Ahadith(أحاديث) you memorize and you know,

381
00:30:29,669 --> 00:30:33,178
understanding is the Fiqh(فقه) of the heart, the understanding of the heart.

382
00:30:34,057 --> 00:30:39,110
Because anybody can memorize Qur'an and Hadith(حديث), even a non Muslim could do that.

383
00:30:39,882 --> 00:30:46,622
I mean, there are Islamic Studies departments in many universities, in the West and other parts of the world.

384
00:30:47,018 --> 00:30:50,153
And many of the students who get the top grades over there are non Muslim.

385
00:30:50,476 --> 00:30:56,803
So, they know Ahadith(احاديث) and they know Ayaat(آيات), so is that the criteria of true knowledge? No.

386
00:30:57,566 --> 00:31:02,168
True Knowledge is not how much Ayaat(آيات) and Ahadith(احاديث) you have learned.

387
00:31:02,500 --> 00:31:05,479
But how much do you understand them and follow them.

388
00:31:05,786 --> 00:31:08,899
Because if you are just memorizing Ayaat(آيات) and Ahadith(احاديث)

389
00:31:08,923 --> 00:31:12,068
you're just adding up evidence against you on the Day of Judgment,

390
00:31:12,512 --> 00:31:15,954
because every Ayah(آية) that you know will be an evidence against you, on the Day Of Judgment,

391
00:31:15,994 --> 00:31:17,555
you're actually making it worse for yourself.

392
00:31:18,062 --> 00:31:21,242
And every Hadith(حديث) that you learn will be evidence against you because you knew it,

393
00:31:21,590 --> 00:31:23,205
and he didn't follow it and you did nothing.

394
00:31:23,599 --> 00:31:25,939
So, actually, you're worse than somebody who didn't know it.

395
00:31:26,387 --> 00:31:28,294
Because the one who didn't know it, can say on the Day of Judgment.

396
00:31:28,327 --> 00:31:31,023
O Allah I never knew about this, nobody told me about it.

397
00:31:31,511 --> 00:31:33,840
But the one who knows it has no excuse at all.

398
00:31:34,368 --> 00:31:37,052
And these people knew the truth and they didn't follow it.

399
00:31:37,845 --> 00:31:40,044
So, the Fiqh(فقه), and this is very important.

400
00:31:40,552 --> 00:31:43,084
Don't be deceived, by sweet tongue.

401
00:31:43,125 --> 00:31:51,313
And don't be deceived by people, who have wrote, they just memorize everything and they just spit it out to you.

402
00:31:51,868 --> 00:31:56,738
But it's, you should take the example by the ones, who are following the Haqq(حق),

403
00:31:57,110 --> 00:31:58,615
not the ones who are just saying it.

404
00:31:59,166 --> 00:32:01,946
The ones, who are saying it, if they're saying the Haqq(حق) than follow it yourself,

405
00:32:02,882 --> 00:32:06,730
then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says, about the ones who understand.

406
00:32:06,770 --> 00:32:15,815
لَٰكِنِ الرَّسُولُ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا مَعَهُ جَاهَدُوا بِأَمْوَالِهِمْ وَأَنْفُسِهِمْ

407
00:32:16,131 --> 00:32:26,544
وَأُولَٰئِكَ لَهُمُ الْخَيْرَاتُ ۖ وَأُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْمُفْلِحُونَ۝

408
00:32:27,251 --> 00:32:32,607
But the messenger and those, who believed with him, fought with their wealth and their lives.

409
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:38,029
Those will have all that is good and it is those who are successful.

410
00:32:38,541 --> 00:32:52,377
أَعَدَّ اللَّهُ لَهُمْ جَنَّاتٍ تَجْرِي مِنْ تَحْتِهَا الْأَنْهَارُ خَالِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ الْفَوْزُ الْعَظِيمُ۝

411
00:32:52,631 --> 00:32:56,939
Allah has prepared for them gardens beneath, which rivers flow,

412
00:32:57,108 --> 00:33:02,020
where in they will abide eternally, that is the great attainment.

413
00:33:02,448 --> 00:33:03,645
Then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

414
00:33:03,742 --> 00:33:14,918
وَجَاءَ الْمُعَذِّرُونَ مِنَ الْأَعْرَابِ لِيُؤْذَنَ لَهُمْ وَقَعَدَ الَّذِينَ كَذَبُوا اللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُ ۚ

415
00:33:15,224 --> 00:33:20,791
And those with excuses among the Bedouins came to be permitted to remain.

416
00:33:21,006 --> 00:33:23,789
These are some Bedouins who had valid excuses.

417
00:33:23,829 --> 00:33:28,413
They came to Rasool Allah ﷺ, according to some Mufassireen(مفسرين), they say they have valid excuses,

418
00:33:28,437 --> 00:33:30,165
and some of them say that they didn't.

419
00:33:30,435 --> 00:33:33,793
There's a difference of opinion on the exact meaning of this part of the Ayah(آية),

420
00:33:34,095 --> 00:33:40,550
but then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says and they who had lied to Allah and His Messenger sat at home.

421
00:33:40,922 --> 00:33:47,086
سَيُصِيبُ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا مِنْهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ۝

422
00:33:47,497 --> 00:33:51,645
There will strike those, who disbelieved are among them, a painful punishment.

423
00:33:52,516 --> 00:33:56,884
Now, we recited this Ayah(آية) the ones, who are excused from going out.

424
00:33:57,451 --> 00:34:02,525
There is not upon the weak or upon the ill or upon those, who do not find anything to spend,

425
00:34:02,549 --> 00:34:06,422
any discomfort when they are sincere to Allah and His Messenger,

426
00:34:06,446 --> 00:34:10,622
there is not upon the doers of good any cause for blame and Allah is forgiving and merciful.

427
00:34:11,043 --> 00:34:13,851
The next Ayah(آية), talks about some of the Sahabah(صحابه),

428
00:34:14,117 --> 00:34:18,864
who came to Rasool Allah ﷺ and they said: O Rasool Allah carry us,

429
00:34:18,888 --> 00:34:22,627
meaning provide us with transportation, we have nothing.

430
00:34:23,445 --> 00:34:28,458
Because part of the preparation is that you need to have your camel or your horse to travel.

431
00:34:28,625 --> 00:34:32,495
This is the long distance, you can't just go without any preparation.

432
00:34:32,817 --> 00:34:36,064
So, these were very poor Sahabah(صحابه), but they sincerely want to go.

433
00:34:36,294 --> 00:34:40,484
So, they came to Rasool Ullah and said: O Rasool Ullah provide for us, help us we want to join.

434
00:34:41,029 --> 00:34:41,950
Rasool Allah ﷺ said:

435
00:34:41,974 --> 00:34:43,280
لَا اَجِدُ مَا أحمِلُكُمْ عليهَا

436
00:34:43,305 --> 00:34:46,058
I cannot provide you with anything! I don't have anything.

437
00:34:46,508 --> 00:34:53,295
They were so sad that they were deprived from the honor of joining this army

438
00:34:53,524 --> 00:34:56,253
that they left with tears flowing on their cheeks.

439
00:34:57,000 --> 00:35:01,105
So, you can see the contrast here between some people who have wealth and have the ability

440
00:35:01,643 --> 00:35:04,328
and they are happy to stay behind,

441
00:35:04,352 --> 00:35:05,343
فَرِحَ الْمُخَلَّفُونَ

442
00:35:05,367 --> 00:35:07,596
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says: They were happy to stay behind.

443
00:35:08,318 --> 00:35:12,877
And on the other hand, you have these poor Sahabah(صحابه), who eagerly want to go

444
00:35:12,916 --> 00:35:14,769
and when they were prevented, they cried.

445
00:35:15,453 --> 00:35:18,326
So, there's a difference in the hearts here between these and those.

446
00:35:19,026 --> 00:35:20,113
 So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

447
00:35:20,238 --> 00:35:32,808
وَلَا عَلَى الَّذِينَ إِذَا مَا أَتَوْكَ لِتَحْمِلَهُمْ قُلْتَ لَا أَجِدُ مَا أَحْمِلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ

448
00:35:33,109 --> 00:35:42,371
تَوَلَّوْا وَأَعْيُنُهُمْ تَفِيضُ مِنَ الدَّمْعِ حَزَنًا أَلَّا يَجِدُوا مَا يُنْفِقُونَ۝

449
00:35:42,698 --> 00:35:50,198
Nor is there blame upon those who, when they came to you, that you might give them mounts, you said;

450
00:35:50,262 --> 00:35:52,811
 I can find nothing for you to ride upon.

451
00:35:53,616 --> 00:35:58,772
They turned back while their eyes overflowed with tears out of grief,

452
00:35:59,229 --> 00:36:02,632
that they could not find something to spend for the cause of Allah.

453
00:36:03,105 --> 00:36:10,913
إِنَّمَا السَّبِيلُ عَلَى الَّذِينَ يَسْتَأْذِنُونَكَ وَهُمْ أَغْنِيَاءُ

454
00:36:11,184 --> 00:36:21,711
رَضُوا بِأَنْ يَكُونُوا مَعَ الْخَوَالِفِ وَطَبَعَ اللَّهُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ۝

455
00:36:22,286 --> 00:36:29,490
The cause for blame is only upon those, who ask permission of you, while they are rich,

456
00:36:29,895 --> 00:36:33,159
 they are satisfied to be with those who stay behind

457
00:36:33,432 --> 00:36:36,923
and Allah has sealed over their hearts, so they do not know.

458
00:36:36,963 --> 00:36:40,730
So, Allah said in the previous Ayah(آية) La Yafqahoon(لا يفقهون), they have no Fiqh(فقه).

459
00:36:40,906 --> 00:36:44,052
And in this Ayah(آية)  La Yalamoon(لا يعلمون), they have no knowledge.

460
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:48,513
So, they have no understanding and they have no knowledge, they don't have either.

461
00:36:49,180 --> 00:36:50,921
Allah says about the Munafiqeen(منافقين).

462
00:36:50,945 --> 00:36:59,281
لو كَانَ عَرَضًا قَرِيبًا وَسَفَرًا قَاصِدًا لَاتَّبَعُوكَ وَلَٰكِنْ

463
00:36:59,622 --> 00:37:03,717
وَلَٰكِنْ بَعُدَتْ عَلَيْهِمُ الشُّقَّةُ

464
00:37:03,964 --> 00:37:10,458
 وَسَيَحْلِفُونَ بِاللَّهِ لَوِ اسْتَطَعْنَا لَخَرَجْنَا مَعَكُمْ

465
00:37:10,727 --> 00:37:19,206
 يُهْلِكُونَ أَنْفُسَهُمْ وَاللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ إِنَّهُمْ لَكَاذِبُونَ۝

466
00:37:19,861 --> 00:37:25,024
Had it been an easy gain and a moderate trip, meaning if there was a lot of Ghaneemah(غنيمه).

467
00:37:25,505 --> 00:37:30,989
And if the distance wasn't far away, the hypocrites would have followed you.

468
00:37:31,539 --> 00:37:33,867
But distant to them was the journey.

469
00:37:34,284 --> 00:37:39,565
And they will swear by Allah if we were able, we would have gone forth with you.

470
00:37:40,077 --> 00:37:46,546
Destroying themselves through false oaths and Allah knows that indeed, they are liars.

471
00:37:47,128 --> 00:37:58,777
عَفَا اللَّهُ عَنْكَ لِمَ أَذِنْتَ لَهُمْ حَتَّىٰ يَتَبَيَّنَ لَكَ الَّذِينَ صَدَقُوا وَتَعْلَمَ الْكَاذِبِينَ۝

472
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:02,541
Allah is telling Muhammadﷺ that you should not have excused them, Allah says;

473
00:38:02,811 --> 00:38:07,768
May Allah pardon you, O Muhammad(محمد), why did you give them permission to remain behind?

474
00:38:08,241 --> 00:38:13,031
You should not have, until it was evident to you, who were the truthful,

475
00:38:13,254 --> 00:38:15,820
and you knew, who were the liars.

476
00:38:15,860 --> 00:38:17,206
So, it was a test from Allah.

477
00:38:17,516 --> 00:38:21,029
And Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling Muhammadﷺ that you should not have given them an excuse.

478
00:38:21,499 --> 00:38:26,740
And then Allah tells us who are the true believers, and who are not. Allah says;

479
00:38:27,109 --> 00:38:39,115
لَا يَسْتَأْذِنُكَ الَّذِينَ يُؤْمِنُونَ بِاللَّهِ وَالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ أَنْ يُجَاهِدُوا بِأَمْوَالِهِمْ وَأَنْفُسِهِمْ ۗ

480
00:38:39,528 --> 00:38:44,435
وَاللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ بِالْمُتَّقِينَ۝

481
00:38:44,848 --> 00:38:51,128
Those who, believe in Allah, and the last day would not ask permission of you to be excused

482
00:38:51,569 --> 00:38:57,116
from fighting with their wealth and their lives and Allah is knowing of those, who fear Him.

483
00:38:57,462 --> 00:39:01,079
So, the ones who have Taqwa(تقوى) and the ones, who believe in Allah,

484
00:39:01,333 --> 00:39:04,707
they're not going to try to find excuses, but you would find them eager

485
00:39:05,033 --> 00:39:07,104
to support the religion of Allah and fight for it.

486
00:39:07,988 --> 00:39:11,965
But then the ones who are looking for excuses, Allah says about them;

487
00:39:12,242 --> 00:39:23,233
إِنَّمَا يَسْتَأْذِنُكَ الَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِاللَّهِ وَالْيَوْمِ الْآخِرِ وَارْتَابَتْ قُلُوبُهُمْ فَهُمْ

488
00:39:23,558 --> 00:39:27,629
قُلُوبُهُمْ فَهُمْ فِي رَيْبِهِمْ يَتَرَدَّدُونَ۝

489
00:39:27,813 --> 00:39:33,945
Only those would ask permission of you, who do not believe in Allah and the Last Day,

490
00:39:34,081 --> 00:39:36,490
and whose hearts have doubted.

491
00:39:36,776 --> 00:39:40,339
And they are in their doubts are hesitating.

492
00:39:40,505 --> 00:39:47,208
And this is a fact, those who misinterpret the concept of fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله),

493
00:39:47,232 --> 00:39:50,295
and those who have weak Eeman(ايمان) and try to get out of it.

494
00:39:50,572 --> 00:39:52,846
They are always in a state of hesitation,

495
00:39:52,886 --> 00:39:54,925
they're always in a state of unclarity,

496
00:39:55,187 --> 00:39:56,995
they're in a state of contradiction,

497
00:39:57,202 --> 00:40:01,397
because they say on one hand, that we want to support the religion of Allahعَزّوجَلّ,

498
00:40:01,606 --> 00:40:03,672
but then they refused to do it.

499
00:40:03,820 --> 00:40:08,263
And they try to find excuses to get out of it, so it's the contradicting state.

500
00:40:08,629 --> 00:40:12,565
And it's a very changing heart, and Allahعَزّوجَلّ says about them,

501
00:40:12,746 --> 00:40:15,192
they do not have true believe in Allah and the last day,

502
00:40:15,364 --> 00:40:20,363
somebody who has Yaqeen(يقين) in Aakhira(آخرة), and somebody who has true Eeman(ايمان) in Allahعَزّوجَلّ,

503
00:40:20,787 --> 00:40:23,077
first of all, because of the Eeman(ايمان) in Allah,

504
00:40:23,116 --> 00:40:26,552
he will fear Allah more than he fears anybody or anything else.

505
00:40:26,885 --> 00:40:34,047
And because of the Eeman(ايمان) in the last Day, he will not have any value of this Duniyah(دُنِيَّا).

506
00:40:34,903 --> 00:40:36,633
And then Allah says about them.

507
00:40:36,941 --> 00:40:43,264
And this is a criteria for those who are really excused and those who are not. Allah says;

508
00:40:43,611 --> 00:40:53,687
وَلَوْ أَرَادُوا الْخُرُوجَ لَأَعَدُّوا لَهُ عُدَّةً وَلَٰكِنْ كَرِهَ اللَّهُ انْبِعَاثَهُمْ

509
00:40:53,986 --> 00:41:00,053
وَلَٰكِنْ كَرِهَ اللَّهُ انْبِعَاثَهُمْ فَثَبَّطَهُمْ

510
00:41:00,473 --> 00:41:05,687
فَثَبَّطَهُمْ وَقِيلَ اقْعُدُوا مَعَ الْقَاعِدِينَ۝

511
00:41:06,111 --> 00:41:09,958
And if they had intended to go forth, they would have prepared for it.

512
00:41:10,555 --> 00:41:13,433
Brothers and sisters, anything important needs preparation.

513
00:41:14,248 --> 00:41:17,799
If you want to be a physician, you need to prepare for it, you need to go to school.

514
00:41:18,377 --> 00:41:22,595
If you want to be an engineer, you have to go through years of education.

515
00:41:23,005 --> 00:41:28,767
And same thing in Islam, just like in Duniyah(دنيا), any job or any profession needs a preparation,

516
00:41:28,792 --> 00:41:30,061
otherwise you are lying.

517
00:41:30,510 --> 00:41:33,356
I mean, if somebody says I want to be a doctor, but then he doesn't go to college,

518
00:41:33,751 --> 00:41:37,313
and somebody says I want to find employment, but he never goes and search for it.

519
00:41:37,912 --> 00:41:39,547
Is dishonest with himself.

520
00:41:40,563 --> 00:41:46,798
Same thing in Islam, if you say for example, you want to make Hijrah(هجرة) Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله), and you don't prepare for it.

521
00:41:47,124 --> 00:41:48,496
 You're being dishonest with yourself.

522
00:41:48,520 --> 00:41:52,875
And if you say that you want to strive in the path of Allahعَزّوجَلّ

523
00:41:52,899 --> 00:41:57,045
but you're not doing any preparation for it, then that's also not an excuse

524
00:41:57,125 --> 00:42:02,601
 because those, who sincerely want to strive in the cause of Allah are going to prepare

525
00:42:03,031 --> 00:42:10,058
The term preparation is broad, it will include anything that is needed for such a Ibadah(عبادة)

526
00:42:10,532 --> 00:42:14,918
and then Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling Muhammadﷺ that it's better that these people did not come out.

527
00:42:14,942 --> 00:42:16,858
Why? Because this is what they will do.

528
00:42:17,088 --> 00:42:23,705
لَوْ خَرَجُوا فِيكُمْ مَا زَادُوكُمْ إِلَّا خَبَالًا

529
00:42:23,927 --> 00:42:36,880
 وَلَأَوْضَعُوا خِلَالَكُمْ يَبْغُونَكُمُ الْفِتْنَةَ وَفِيكُمْ سَمَّاعُونَ لَهُمْ ۗ وَاللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ بِالظَّالِمِينَ۝

530
00:42:37,340 --> 00:42:43,202
Had they gone forth with you, they would not have increased you, except in confusion.

531
00:42:43,827 --> 00:42:45,571
They would not increase you, in anything good.

532
00:42:45,777 --> 00:42:48,995
They would add to the confusion because their minds are full of doubts.

533
00:42:49,533 --> 00:42:53,102
They do not have a firm Yaqeen(يقين) and Eeman(ايمان) in what they're doing.

534
00:42:53,127 --> 00:42:55,938
They're confused, they have so many doubts in their hearts.

535
00:42:56,332 --> 00:42:59,373
They have doubts from the news, they have doubts from the Munafiqeen(منافقين),

536
00:42:59,398 --> 00:43:02,851
they have doubts from the Kuffar(كفار), their minds are full of doubts.

537
00:43:03,239 --> 00:43:06,162
And if they come out with you, they will just add confusion.

538
00:43:07,018 --> 00:43:10,128
And then Allah says and they would have been active among you.

539
00:43:10,168 --> 00:43:11,053
Active with what?

540
00:43:11,351 --> 00:43:14,749
Seeking to cause you Fitnah(فِتْنَه), they're going to come out for the cause of Fitnah(فِتْنَه).

541
00:43:15,143 --> 00:43:18,909
They're going to come out with Nameema(نميمة), backbiting, they're going to try

542
00:43:18,934 --> 00:43:23,783
to cause disunity among you, they will spread their doubts among your ranks,

543
00:43:24,104 --> 00:43:29,013
and Allahعَزّوجَلّ says and among you are avid listeners to them,

544
00:43:29,196 --> 00:43:30,886
Allah is knowing of the wrongdoers.

545
00:43:30,926 --> 00:43:32,011
 Who's Allah speaking to?

546
00:43:32,165 --> 00:43:34,043
He is speaking to the generation of the Sahabah(صحابه).

547
00:43:34,425 --> 00:43:37,867
Allah is telling them and among you are avid listeners to them.

548
00:43:37,907 --> 00:43:41,265
Subhaan Allah(سبحان الله) how could a companion be an avid listener of a Munafiq(منافق)?

549
00:43:41,754 --> 00:43:48,032
Well, that's the whole point behind the importance of warning against the Munafiqeen(منافقين)

550
00:43:48,072 --> 00:43:53,451
because they are so elusive, it's very difficult to tell, who a Munafiq(منافق) is?

551
00:43:54,190 --> 00:43:56,316
Because they could be very sweet tongue,

552
00:43:56,768 --> 00:43:58,432
they could be very knowledgeable,

553
00:43:58,510 --> 00:44:00,232
they could be very prominent,

554
00:44:00,732 --> 00:44:03,375
they could be very charismatic,

555
00:44:03,709 --> 00:44:06,727
they could have such a captivating personality.

556
00:44:07,260 --> 00:44:11,071
And you look up to them, and you listen to their words.

557
00:44:11,692 --> 00:44:14,913
And their words make sense to you.

558
00:44:15,342 --> 00:44:18,453
And that's why you become an avid listener to them.

559
00:44:18,905 --> 00:44:21,120
And in reality, they are deceiving you,

560
00:44:21,532 --> 00:44:24,627
and Allahعَزّوجَلّ is giving this warning to the Sahabah(صحابه).

561
00:44:24,676 --> 00:44:26,975
So, what do you think about us today?

562
00:44:27,163 --> 00:44:31,096
How much confusion are these Munafiqeen(منافقين) causing us today?

563
00:44:31,761 --> 00:44:35,163
When we are very far away from the understanding of the Sahabah(صحابه),

564
00:44:35,361 --> 00:44:39,157
when our Fitrah(فطرة) is corrupted because the Sahabah(صحابه) had a clean Fitrah(فطرة).

565
00:44:39,578 --> 00:44:42,393
I mean for them, because of their clean Fitrah(فطرة),

566
00:44:42,749 --> 00:44:45,730
 they would have a better ability in distinguishing what is right from wrong.

567
00:44:45,933 --> 00:44:49,672
However, with us living in such a corrupt material world,

568
00:44:50,105 --> 00:44:55,651
where the values and the norms that we are brought up with, are so messed up.

569
00:44:56,388 --> 00:44:58,373
The confusion is even worse.

570
00:44:58,801 --> 00:45:04,200
And that is why, you find that a wide section of the Ummah(امة) is really confused.

571
00:45:04,842 --> 00:45:07,372
They don't know what they're supposed to do?

572
00:45:07,557 --> 00:45:09,605
They don't know what their duties are.?

573
00:45:09,764 --> 00:45:11,549
They're in state of loss.

574
00:45:12,056 --> 00:45:16,246
Brothers and sisters is very important to study the Ayaat(آيات) of Surah At-Taubah(سورة التوبة)

575
00:45:16,598 --> 00:45:19,457
and study the Ayaat(آيات) of Munafiqeen(منافقين) in Ayaat Ut-Taubah(آيات التوبة),

576
00:45:19,617 --> 00:45:22,627
so that we could be cautious from two things.

577
00:45:22,651 --> 00:45:24,965
Number one, that we are not Munafiqeen(منافقين) ourselves.

578
00:45:25,391 --> 00:45:33,017
And number two, that we do not fall into or not fooled by the ones, who are Munafiqeen(منافقين).

579
00:45:33,896 --> 00:45:38,267
I mean, Nifaaq(نفاق) is such a delicate thing and very elusive thing, that

580
00:45:38,692 --> 00:45:43,105
even Umar Ibn Al-Khattab رضي الله عنه used to fear that he might be a Munafiq(منافق).

581
00:45:43,149 --> 00:45:48,675
Subhaan Allah(سبحان الله) Umar(عمر) and he would go to Hudaifah(حديفه), the one, who had the secret of Rasool Allah ﷺ

582
00:45:48,715 --> 00:45:50,459
and he knew the names of the Munafiqeen(منافقين).

583
00:45:50,697 --> 00:45:53,114
He went to him and he said: I ask you in the name of Allah,

584
00:45:53,378 --> 00:45:55,775
Did Rasool Ullah mentioned me among the Munafiqeen(منافقين).?

585
00:45:56,213 --> 00:46:01,502
Hudaifah(حديفه) told him: No. And I'm not gonna answer this question to anyone other than you.

586
00:46:02,082 --> 00:46:05,558
Because it's secret and Hudaifah(حديفه) did not want to give it up.

587
00:46:06,278 --> 00:46:09,966
And so Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling the Muslims that is better than they didn't come out

588
00:46:09,990 --> 00:46:13,177
because if they came out, they're not really into fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله).

589
00:46:13,201 --> 00:46:15,025
They don't understand fighting Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله),

590
00:46:15,178 --> 00:46:19,433
and therefore they're going to come out and just cause confusion amongst you.

591
00:46:19,797 --> 00:46:27,185
لَقَدِ ابْتَغَوُا الْفِتْنَةَ مِنْ قَبْلُ وَقَلَّبُوا لَكَ الْأُمُورَ

592
00:46:27,503 --> 00:46:41,280
وَقَلَّبُوا لَكَ الْأُمُورَ حَتَّىٰ جَاءَ الْحَقُّ وَظَهَرَ أَمْرُ اللَّهِ وَهُمْ كَارِهُونَ۝

593
00:46:41,624 --> 00:46:48,299
They had already desired destination before, and had upset matters for you, until the truth came,

594
00:46:48,584 --> 00:46:51,757
and the ordinance of Allah appeared, while they were averse,

595
00:46:52,246 --> 00:46:55,873
Abdullah Bin Ubae(عبدالله بن أبي) such a despised individual.

596
00:46:55,898 --> 00:46:58,180
We all hate him because we know that he is a Munafiq(منافق).

597
00:46:58,676 --> 00:47:00,719
But let's put things in the right context

598
00:47:00,743 --> 00:47:04,687
Abdullah Bin Ubae(عبدالله بن أبي) was the leader of his people, he was Sayed Al-Kharaj(سيدالخزرج),

599
00:47:05,019 --> 00:47:07,685
he was the lord of Al-Khazraj(ألخزرج), their chief

600
00:47:07,885 --> 00:47:14,822
and Abdullah Bin Ubae(عبدالله بن أبي) used to stand before Rasool Allah ﷺ, when he would give Khutba tul Jummah(خطبة الجمعه).

601
00:47:15,236 --> 00:47:21,154
And tell the people that Muhammadﷺ is the Messenger of Allah, so listen to his words.

602
00:47:21,467 --> 00:47:28,097
I mean, he is standing in front of the people before the Khut'bah(خطبه), introducing the Khut'ba(خطبه) of Rasool Allah ﷺ, telling people to listen to him.

603
00:47:28,274 --> 00:47:31,756
And when Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمر ابن الخطاب) told Rasool Allah ﷺ that we should kill him,

604
00:47:31,780 --> 00:47:34,508
Rasool Allah ﷺ mentions in one narration,

605
00:47:34,880 --> 00:47:36,135
سَتَرْغَم لَه’ اُنُفْ

606
00:47:36,397 --> 00:47:39,240
There are many men, who might fight for him.

607
00:47:39,503 --> 00:47:43,186
Subhaan Allah(سبحان الله), Abdullah Bin Ubae(عبدالله بن أبي), had a great following,

608
00:47:43,226 --> 00:47:48,267
and some of the people who are deceived by him might not handle it well,

609
00:47:48,338 --> 00:47:52,322
and that's why Rasool Allah ﷺ refused to execute him.

610
00:47:52,788 --> 00:47:54,836
So, these were prominent members in the society,

611
00:47:54,876 --> 00:47:59,930
and they have caused such dissension among the Muslims and problems in the past,

612
00:48:00,389 --> 00:48:03,716
as Allahعزوَجل says, in the Ayah(آية), I just recited,

613
00:48:04,278 --> 00:48:15,071
وَمِنْهُمْ مَنْ يَقُولُ ائْذَنْ لِي وَلَا تَفْتِنِّي ۚ أَلَا فِي الْفِتْنَةِ سَقَطُوا ۗ

614
00:48:15,302 --> 00:48:22,052
وَإِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ لَمُحِيطَةٌ بِالْكَافِرِينَ۝

615
00:48:22,469 --> 00:48:26,560
Rasool Allah ﷺ told Al-Jadd Bin Qais(الجد بن قيس) and he is one of the leaders of Al-Munafiqeen(ألمنافقين)

616
00:48:26,963 --> 00:48:30,648
he told him, are you ready for fighting the Romans?

617
00:48:31,231 --> 00:48:32,540
Al-Jadd Bin Qais(الجد بن قيس) said;

618
00:48:33,009 --> 00:48:40,892
O Messenger Of Allah my people know, I have a reputation of being a man, who loves women so much,

619
00:48:41,226 --> 00:48:48,040
 and I fear for myself, if I go with you, that I might fall into Fitnah(فِتْنَه),

620
00:48:48,365 --> 00:48:50,575
because of the women of the women of Bannu Asfar(بنو الاصفر),

621
00:48:50,849 --> 00:48:54,715
Bannu Asfar(بنو الاصفر) is the name that is given to the Romans, Asfar(أصفر) is yellow.

622
00:48:55,094 --> 00:48:57,967
So, the children of Asfar(أصفر) or the people that are yellow,

623
00:48:58,061 --> 00:49:01,567
that was the color that was was given to them as their description.

624
00:49:01,825 --> 00:49:03,412
So, Al-Jadd Bin Qais(الجد بن قيس) is saying;

625
00:49:03,555 --> 00:49:06,772
If I go to you, the women over there are going to cause me Fitnah(فِتْنَه).

626
00:49:07,108 --> 00:49:12,815
So, the reason why he wanted to stay, behind is to stay away from Fitnah(فِتْنَه)

627
00:49:13,217 --> 00:49:16,584
which you can see that he gave himself an excuse,

628
00:49:16,825 --> 00:49:21,212
as if it is for the sake of Allah, you know, I don't want to go out and fight

629
00:49:21,568 --> 00:49:25,021
because it's going to cause me Fitnah(فِتْنَه), I might fall into Haram(حرام).

630
00:49:25,425 --> 00:49:26,842
So, Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

631
00:49:27,181 --> 00:49:30,020
وَمِنْهُمْ مَنْ يَقُولُ ائْذَنْ لِي وَلَا تَفْتِنِّي ۚ أَلَا فِي الْفِتْنَةِ سَقَطُوا

632
00:49:30,342 --> 00:49:36,839
And among them is he, who says permit me to remain at home and do not put me to trial.

633
00:49:36,863 --> 00:49:38,889
Trial here is translation of Fitnah(فِتْنَه),

634
00:49:39,683 --> 00:49:44,080
unquestionably into trial they have fallen.

635
00:49:45,276 --> 00:49:48,808
And indeed, hell will encompass the disbelievers.

636
00:49:48,871 --> 00:49:54,038
Allahعَزّوجَلّ is telling us that by staying behind you're staying in Fitnah(فِتْنَه),

637
00:49:54,425 --> 00:49:58,980
if you go, you will be spared Fitnah(فِتْنَه), if you stay behind, then you're in Fitnah(فِتْنَه).

638
00:49:59,852 --> 00:50:04,992
So, the ones who always talk about the excuse that I'm not prepared spiritually,

639
00:50:05,016 --> 00:50:09,536
I'm not prepared this or that, they will never be prepared spiritually

640
00:50:09,561 --> 00:50:12,581
if they stay behind because they're always going to be in a state of Fitnah(فِتْنَه).

641
00:50:13,209 --> 00:50:16,868
It is when they go out Fee-Sabeel-Lillah(فِي سَبيل الله) that they will be free of the Fitnah(فِتْنَه).

642
00:50:17,224 --> 00:50:18,714
And that's why Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

643
00:50:18,738 --> 00:50:21,089
وَالَّذِينَ جَاهَدُوا فِينَا لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ سُبُلَنَا

644
00:50:21,607 --> 00:50:26,305
The ones, who are struggling in our cause Allah will guide them, to Our paths.

645
00:50:26,675 --> 00:50:32,106
So, guidance comes with going out. Allahعَزّوجَلّ your says about the Al-Munafiqeen(ألمنافقين).

646
00:50:32,231 --> 00:50:37,121
إِنْ تُصِبْكَ حَسَنَةٌ تَسُؤْهُمْ ۖ

647
00:50:37,256 --> 00:50:48,994
وَإِنْ تُصِبْكَ مُصِيبَةٌ يَقُولُوا قَدْ أَخَذْنَا أَمْرَنَا مِنْ قَبْلُ وَيَتَوَلَّوْا وَهُمْ فَرِحُونَ۝

648
00:50:49,489 --> 00:50:52,060
If good befalls you, it distresses them

649
00:50:52,100 --> 00:50:59,184
but if disaster strikes you they say we took our matter in hand before and turned away while they are rejoicing.

650
00:50:59,695 --> 00:51:05,173
This is another habits of the Al-Munafiqeen(ألمنافقين), they are happy when disaster befalls the Muslims.

651
00:51:05,622 --> 00:51:08,410
And when that happens and they stayed behind they would say;

652
00:51:08,524 --> 00:51:11,421
 See we told you, why did you go out?

653
00:51:11,723 --> 00:51:15,722
And they think that they are wise because they avoided trouble

654
00:51:16,241 --> 00:51:19,851
and it's actually the opposite, they are falling into trouble.

655
00:51:20,738 --> 00:51:22,672
And then Allahعَزّوجَلّ says;

656
00:51:22,774 --> 00:51:30,088
قُلْ هَلْ تَرَبَّصُونَ بِنَا إِلَّا إِحْدَى الْحُسْنَيَيْنِ ۖ

657
00:51:30,377 --> 00:51:45,759
وَنَحْنُ نَتَرَبَّصُ بِكُمْ أَنْ يُصِيبَكُمُ اللَّهُ بِعَذَابٍ مِنْ عِنْدِهِ أَوْ بِأَيْدِينَا ۖ

658
00:51:45,949 --> 00:51:52,836
فَتَرَبَّصُوا إِنَّا مَعَكُمْ مُتَرَبِّصُونَ۝

659
00:51:53,357 --> 00:51:57,941
Allahعَزّوجَلّ says; Say do you await for us except, one of the two best things.

660
00:51:58,431 --> 00:52:00,020
What are the two best things.?

661
00:52:00,306 --> 00:52:01,885
Either victory or martyrdom.

662
00:52:02,072 --> 00:52:03,616
While we await for you

663
00:52:04,023 --> 00:52:08,767
that Allahعَزّوجَلّ will afflict you with punishment from himself or at our hands.

664
00:52:08,855 --> 00:52:12,028
So, wait indeed we along you are waiting.

665
00:52:12,417 --> 00:52:15,361
So, wait indeed we along with you are waiting.

666
00:52:15,590 --> 00:52:18,550
So, the Muslim should tell the Al-Munafiqeen(ألمنافقين).

667
00:52:18,718 --> 00:52:22,797
that whatever happens to us, even if we defeated, even if we lose,

668
00:52:23,259 --> 00:52:26,884
and you think that you're wise and smart that you stayed behind,

669
00:52:27,255 --> 00:52:33,639
you need to understand that our objective is one of two things, either victory or martyrdom.

670
00:52:34,518 --> 00:52:37,102
And these are the best things to wait for.

671
00:52:37,466 --> 00:52:40,356
While we are waiting for also two things to happen to you

672
00:52:40,380 --> 00:52:43,901
either a punishment from Allah or a punishment from us.

673
00:52:44,241 --> 00:52:46,654
So, these are some Ayaat(آيات) that we're talking about

674
00:52:46,884 --> 00:52:52,204
the ones who stayed behind in the Battle of Tabook(تبوك).

675
00:52:52,622 --> 00:52:56,719
In Sha Allah ho Ta'ala(اِن ْشاء الله تعالى) we'll carry on in our next session.

676
00:52:57,286 --> 00:52:59,979
السلام عليكم ورحمة الله وبركاته

